	 * Protocol ExternalPort RemoteHost InternalClient Result
	 *     =         =           ≠           ≠         Failure
	 *     =         =           ≠           =         Failure or success
	 *                                                 (vendor specific)
	 *     =         =           =           ≠         Failure
	 *     =         =           =           =         Success (overwrite)
	 */
